# Dashboard environment template.
#
# Dev: the SPA runs on http://localhost:8080 (see ADR 0026 §2.1). The Vite dev
# server proxies /v1/* and /socket.io/* to the engine on http://localhost:3000.
# Prod: nginx in the dashboard container terminates :80 and reverse-proxies the
# same paths to the engine service on the docker network (ADR 0026 §2.5).
#
# Same-origin design — the dashboard does NOT need to know the engine URL.
# This var only matters if you intentionally want a different prod build target
# (e.g. when bundling for an externally hosted dashboard, which M10 does not do).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
